---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
import { GOVERN_PARTNER_URL } from "../../data/docs";
---

<DocsLayout title="Echophi — Event lifecycle">
  <h1>Event lifecycle</h1>
  <ol>
    <li>
      Partner creates a conversation via REST.
    </li>
    <li>
      Core dispatches the dial; JetStream <code>conv.events.*</code> stays internal.
    </li>
    <li>
      Worker maps internal outbox events to the public Partner envelope, evaluates event subscriptions +{" "}
      <code>agent.id</code> filters, then POSTs signed HTTPS webhooks (
      <code>conversation.dispatched</code> → <code>connected</code> → <code>ended</code> / <code>failed</code>).
    </li>
    <li>
      Optional external NATS subject <code>partner.events.{"{customer_id}"}</code> mirrors the same public payload
      when enabled.
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    Inspect each attempt under{" "}
    <a href={GOVERN_PARTNER_URL} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
      Govern → Partner API → Recent Deliveries
    </a>
    .
  </p>
</DocsLayout>
